From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:28:42 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246: Enable
 IPA
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The modem's data goes through the IP Accelerator. Have the kernel load
its GSI firmware, as stock does.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
index 5a162904c..741acd00d 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
@@ -786,6 +786,15 @@ touchscreen@38 {
 	};
 };
 
+&ipa {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sm6450/Sony/columbia/ipa_fws.mbn";
+	memory-region = <&pil_ipa_fw_mem>;
+
+	qcom,gsi-loader = "self";
+
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &lpass_tlmm {
 	status = "okay";
 };
